Generates a personalized practice assessment based on course grades. Example: {'Algorithms': 78, 'Data Structures': 85, 'Software Engineering': 90} Example: {'Algorithms': 10, 'Data Structures': 12} 
Return: A dictionary with recommended subjects and associated practice questions. 
Raises: ValueError: If the grades dictionary is empty or contains invalid data.

